        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blind Bullet is a top-down 2D action shooting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is blind but possesses exceptional hearing, allowing them to perceive their surroundings through echolocation generated by footsteps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, unknown enemies will attack the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When sound waves from footsteps hit the area where an enemy’s attack is coming from, the color of the waves changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to the changes in the echoes to avoid enemy attacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When sound waves from footsteps hit an enemy, the waves flicker, revealing the enemy’s location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is skilled in handling firearms and can effortlessly use a shotgun when acquired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on the echoes to aim and take down enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is unaware of their current situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While they wish to find out what has happened to them and what is going on around them, their blindness limits what they can do alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with companions they meet along the way to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact &amp; Guidelines</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any issues, I would appreciate it if you could contact me via my Discord server or by DM on X (@tesakiza).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The streaming and content guidelines are available at patreon.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blind Bullet is a top-down 2D action shooting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is blind but possesses exceptional hearing, allowing them to perceive their surroundings through echolocation generated by footsteps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evasion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, unknown enemies will attack the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When sound waves from footsteps hit the area where an enemy’s attack is coming from, the color of the waves changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to the changes in the echoes to avoid enemy attacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When sound waves from footsteps hit an enemy, the waves flicker, revealing the enemy’s location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is skilled in handling firearms and can effortlessly use a shotgun when acquired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on the echoes to aim and take down enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is unaware of their current situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While they wish to find out what has happened to them and what is going on around them, their blindness limits what they can do alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with companions they meet along the way to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact &amp; Guidelines</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any issues, I would appreciate it if you could contact me via my Discord server or by DM on X (@tesakiza).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The streaming and content guidelines are available at patreon.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Blind Bullet is a &quot;blind&quot; 2D action shooting game. The player cannot see but can perceive their surroundings through echolocation generated by footsteps. Shoot down unknown enemies with a shotgun, investigate the area with companions, and uncover the truth behind what has happened to them.",
